ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787354756915214001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"93bef5ff-2d06-43b1-90dd-b84b2e6e1a92","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"eac3-ed70-764a-4f9e"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n25 of the 221 bug tickets filed 7–21 Aug 2026 (11%) were duplicates or were refuted during debugging because the agent diagnosed against a stale local tree or a ticket that already existed. `examples/agent-skills/rebar-debug/SKILL.md` mandates a fresh worktree from `origin/main` (lines 40-43) and a sibling sweep (Step 7, lines 741-785) but has no step before Phase 1 that searches the tracker or compares the version the bug was reported against with `main`. The search-before-file rule lives only in `AGENTS.md`. Approved (2026-08-21) with the addition that the agent must compare the reported-against version to `main` as part of the investigation.\n\n## Approach\nAdd \"Step 0 — Orient\" to the skill, before Phase 1: (a) `rebar search \"<symptom words>\"` and `rebar list --status open --type bug`; an existing ticket is linked or resumed instead of filed; (b) record the version the bug was reported against (the `rebar --version` / commit sha in the report, or the tracker ticket's `rebar-version` field) and run `git log --oneline <reported-sha>..origin/main -- <suspect paths>` so the hypothesis phase knows whether the construct changed since the report; (c) confirm the worktree is at `origin/main` (`git rev-parse HEAD` equals `origin/main`). Each step writes one line into the dossier. Task `exemplary-hexahedral-needlefish` (tracker-side duplicate detection) is the complementary work.\n\n## Scope\n`examples/agent-skills/rebar-debug/SKILL.md`, `examples/agent-skills/rebar-debug/phases/` (if the dossier template lives there), `docs/user-guide.md` (one sentence), `tests/unit/test_skill_frontmatter.py` (existing skill lint passes).\n\n## Testing\nDocumentation change; `scripts/check_skill_frontmatter.py` and the docs gates pass.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] SKILL.md contains a Step 0 preceding Phase 1 with the three actions and the dossier lines; checked by reading the file and by `grep -n \"Step 0\" examples/agent-skills/rebar-debug/SKILL.md`.\n- [ ] The hypothesis template cites the reported-against version and the diff range to `main`; checked by the dossier template text.\n- [ ] `make lint` and the docs gates pass; checked by CI.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"examples/agent-skills/rebar-debug/SKILL.md","reason":"approved remediation edit"},{"path":"docs/user-guide.md","reason":"approved remediation edit"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"],["relates_to","eac3-ed70-764a-4f9e"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["gates","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"a4d7-ee6a-99ba-423e","ticket_type":"story","title":"rebar-debug Step 0: search the tracker and compare the reported-against version to main before Phase 1","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bf24c150-88b0-46e1-bf09-cb5852a29bbf","fad42f29-e832-4de3-bc6a-b9ee3a32d916","93bef5ff-2d06-43b1-90dd-b84b2e6e1a92"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787357221604869215,"uuid":"c2df25a6-bd99-43af-ad50-7a9dd01e75c0"}